OL,3,AHundreds of GP practices lose online
OL,4,Aservices after collapse of tech firm
OL,5,ASilicon Practice
OL,6,
OL,7,FPatients in many parts of the country
OL,8,Fhave been left unable to access their
OL,9,FGP surgery online after a tech firm
OL,10,Fwent into administration.
OL,12,FSilicon Practice ran digital services,
OL,13,Fincluding websites, online booking and
OL,14,Fconsultations, for around 500 practices
OL,15,Fin England ` just under 10% of the
OL,16,Ftotal.
OL,18,FPractices across the country, including
OL,19,Fin London, Gloucestershire and Norfolk,
OL,20,Fhave reported problems. Services in
OL,21,FWales are also affected.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
